MODULE: HysteresisNeverRefreshes
TARGET: EventualRefusal
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a stable sub-threshold quota crossing never refreshes its published slot
PERTURBS: Publish

--- FIND
    /\ published[r] = 0 \/ sample[r] - published[r] >= band \/ age[r] >= Refresh
--- REPLACE
    /\ published[r] = 0 \/ sample[r] - published[r] >= band
--- END
